91
00:07:49,243 --> 00:07:54,986
See, some people, they disbelieve, because they don't think that this is the truth.

92
00:07:55,488 --> 00:07:57,152
They think that the Prophet is a liar,

93
00:07:57,192 --> 00:07:58,493
 they think that this is a fake religion,

94
