00:10:07,996 --> 00:10:10,522
So, this young man sits between them,

125
00:10:11,079 --> 00:10:18,560
and he starts bringing up some lines of poetry that talks about the heroic acts of one tribe against the other.

126
00:10:18,767 --> 00:10:25,727
And slowly he was able to cause a shouting match between the two parties.

127
00:10:26,113 --> 00:10:33,087
And after that they stood up and challenged each other to combat,

128
00:10:34,019 --> 00:10:37,062
and they agreed that we will meet in Al-Harrah Fidh Zahira(ألهرة في الظاهره),

129
00:10:37,335 --> 00:10:39,796
 we will meet in such and such place

130
00:10:40,087 --> 00:10:42,311
let's go and arm ourselves.

131
00:10:42,590 --> 00:10:45,944
So, war was about to start all over again.

132
00:10:46,180 --> 00:10:50,058
See how words can cause so much evil.

133
00:10:50,782 --> 00:10:53,198
A war could start because of one word.

134
00:10:53,705 --> 00:10:54,956
That's why Allahعَزّوجَلّ says;

135
00:10:55,154 --> 00:11:10,484
وَقُلْ لِعِبَادِي يَقُولُوا الَّتِي هِيَ أَحْسَنُ ۚ إِنَّ الشَّيْطَانَ يَنْزَغُ بَيْنَهُمْ ۚ إِنَّ الشَّيْطَانَ كَانَ لِلْإِنْسَانِ عَدُوًّا مُبِينًا۝

136
00:11:11,232 --> 00:11:15,392
"Tell my servants to say good words, because Shaytan(شيطان) is there to disunite them."

137
00:11:15,663 --> 00:11:18,291
So, a Muslims should be very careful about what they say.

138
00:11:20,042 --> 00:11:24,809
The news was delivered to Rasool Allah ﷺ and Rasool Allah ﷺ rushed forward.

139
00:11:26,471 --> 00:11:31,087
While they were making an appointment on where to meet,

140
00:11:31,370 --> 00:11:33,186
to start the war all over again.

141
00:11:33,825 --> 00:11:35,296
And Rasool Allah ﷺ said;

142
00:11:36,280 --> 00:11:37,716
O Muslims fear Allah.

143
00:11:38,353 --> 00:11:41,952
Are you to resume the enmity of ignorance?

144
00:11:42,338 --> 00:11:43,940
When I am still among you?

145
00:11:44,227 --> 00:11:47,680
Are you going to bring back Jahilliyah(جاهليه), while I'm still alive and living among you?

146
00:11:48,372 --> 00:11:52,613
After Allah has guided you to believe in Islam and submit to Him?

147
00:11:53,036 --> 00:11:58,636
Do you forget Allah's blessing as He has saved you from ignorance and disbelief

148
00:11:58,863 --> 00:12:02,938
and planted love and friendliness in your hearts, instead of hostility?

149
00:12:03,388 --> 00:12:07,209
Rasool Allah ﷺ is reminding them that this unity was a favor from Allah.

150
00:12:07,464 --> 00:12:09,279
Don't throw it behind your backs.

151
00:12:10,216 --> 00:12:11,526
Allah has brought you together,

152
00:12:11,835 --> 00:12:13,376
Allah has sent you, His Messenger,

153
00:12:13,529 --> 00:12:15,696
Allah has made you love each other.

154
00:12:16,199 --> 00:12:19,252
 The love that now exists among the Sahabah(صحابه) is unsurpassed.

155
00:12:20,394 --> 00:12:24,395
How can you throw that behind your back and go back to the time of Jahilliyyah(جاهليه),

156
00:12:24,435 --> 00:12:27,288
 you know how bad Jahilliyyah(جاهليه) was?

157
00:12:27,939 --> 00:12:33,191
Now since you have tasted Eeman(ايمان), you will know how evil and bad Kuffr(كفر) was.

158
00:12:33,357 --> 00:12:40,847
You know, Rasool Allah ﷺ says that you will only taste the sweetness of faith, if three things happen.

159
00:12:40,887 --> 00:12:42,368
 One of them Rasool Allah ﷺ said

160
00:12:42,753 --> 00:12:47,093
that you would hate to go back to Kuffr(كفر) like you would hate to be thrown in the fire.

161
00:12:47,606 --> 00:12:51,415
So, a person who taste Eeman(إيمان) and knows how beautiful Eeman(إيمان) is,

162
00:12:51,804 --> 00:12:56,008
knows how bad and depressing Kuffr(كفر) is.

163
00:12:56,954 --> 00:13:00,596
And Subhaan Allah(سُبْحَان الله) these words of Rasool Allah ﷺ had so much effect on them,

164
00:13:00,891 --> 00:13:02,336
they started hugging each other.

165
00:13:03,340 --> 00:13:09,568
These men who were just thinking about going to war, are now hugging each other,

166
00:13:10,116 --> 00:13:12,306
 and asking each other for forgiveness.

167
00:13:13,473 --> 00:13:14,800
Allahعَزّوجَلّ says;

168
00:13:15,476 --> 00:13:26,800
قُلْ يَا أَهْلَ الْكِتَابِ لِمَ تَكْفُرُونَ بِآيَاتِ اللَّهِ وَاللَّهُ شَهِيدٌ عَلَىٰ مَا تَعْمَلُونَ۝

169
00:13:27,267 --> 00:13:35,119
قُلْ يَا أَهْلَ الْكِتَابِ لِمَ تَصُدُّونَ عَنْ سَبِيلِ اللَّهِ مَنْ آمَنَ

170
00:13:35,436 --> 00:13:46,119
لِمَ تَصُدُّونَ عَنْ سَبِيلِ اللَّهِ مَنْ آمَنَ تَبْغُونَهَا عِوَجًا وَأَنْتُمْ شُهَدَاءُ ۗ

171
00:13:46,516 --> 00:13:52,023
وَمَا اللَّهُ بِغَافِلٍ عَمَّا تَعْمَلُونَ۝

172
00:13:52,562 --> 00:13:54,212
Say, O People of the Scripture.

173
00:13:54,898 --> 00:13:58,078
Why do you disbelieve in the verses of Allah?

174
00:13:58,425 --> 00:14:01,033
While Allah is witness over, what you do.

175
00:14:01,431 --> 00:14:03,105
Say, O People of the Scripture,

176
00:14:03,429 --> 00:14:07,049
Why do you avert from the way of Allah those who believe,

177
00:14:07,348 --> 00:14:09,837
seeking to make it seem deviant

178
00:14:10,271 --> 00:14:12,285
while you are witnesses to the truth.

179
00:14:12,629 --> 00:14:15,321
And Allah is not unaware of what you do.

180
00:14:15,904 --> 00:14:17,463
And Allahعَزّوجَلّ says;

181
00:14:17,615 --> 00:14:28,978
يَا أَيُّهَا الَّذِينَ آمَنُوا إِنْ تُطِيعُوا فَرِيقًا مِنَ الَّذِينَ أُوتُوا الْكِتَابَ

182
00:14:29,391 --> 00:14:40,293
إِنْ تُطِيعُوا فَرِيقًا مِنَ الَّذِينَ أُوتُوا الْكِتَابَ يَرُدُّوكُمْ بَعْدَ إِيمَانِكُمْ كَافِرِينَ۝

183
00:14:41,268 --> 00:14:46,652
O, you, who have believed, if you obey a party of those, who are given the Scripture,

184
00:14:46,947 --> 00:14:51,399
they would turn you back after your belief to being unbelievers.

185
00:14:51,631 --> 00:14:58,571
So, Allahعَزّوجَلّ says there's only one result of following the People of the Book

186
00:14:58,933 --> 00:15:02,932
and that is, it will make you revert back to disbelief.

187
00:15:03,273 --> 00:15:07,964
So, this is a warning to the Muslims from following Ahl-lil-Kitaab(اَهْل الْكِتَاب), the People of the Book,

188
00:15:08,020 --> 00:15:08,876
 and then Allah says,

189
00:15:09,028 --> 00:15:17,653
وَكَيْفَ تَكْفُرُونَ وَأَنْتُمْ تُتْلَىٰ عَلَيْكُمْ آيَاتُ اللَّهِ وَفِيكُمْ رَسُولُهُ ۗ

190
00:15:17,938 --> 00:15:26,121
وَمَنْ يَعْتَصِمْ بِاللَّهِ فَقَدْ هُدِيَ إِلَىٰ صِرَاطٍ مُسْتَقِيمٍ۝

191
00:15:26,424 --> 00:15:31,215
So, following the book is a one way road that ends in disbelief.

192
00:15:32,727 --> 00:15:33,794
And then Allah says;

193
00:15:34,152 --> 00:15:42,759
 وَكَيْفَ تَكْفُرُونَ وَأَنْتُمْ تُتْلَىٰ عَلَيْكُمْ آيَاتُ اللَّهِ وَفِيكُمْ رَسُولُهُ ۗ

194
00:15:42,981 --> 00:15:51,161
وَمَنْ يَعْتَصِمْ بِاللَّهِ فَقَدْ هُدِيَ إِلَىٰ صِرَاطٍ مُسْتَقِيمٍ۝

195
00:15:51,657 --> 00:15:53,690
O you, who have believed fear Allah,

196
00:15:53,986 --> 00:15:57,749
as He should be feared, and do not die except as Muslims,

197
00:15:58,376 --> 00:16:02,941
and hold firmly to the rope of Allah all together, and do not become divided.

198
00:16:03,409 --> 00:16:06,965
See, because Shaas Bin Qais(شاس بن قيس) wanted to cause division among them,

199
00:16:07,005 --> 00:16:08,608
 Allahعَزّوجَلّ is warning them.

200
00:16:09,182 --> 00:16:11,710
And remember the favor of Allah upon you,

201
00:16:11,890 --> 00:16:16,813
when you were enemies, and he brought your hearts together and you became, by his favor, brothers.

202
00:16:18,038 --> 00:16:23,533
And you were on the edge of a pot of the fire and he saved you, from it.

203
00:16:24,025 --> 00:16:28,213
Thus does Allah make clear to you, His verses that you may be guided

204
00:16:28,832 --> 00:16:33,038
and Let there be arising from you a nation inviting to all that is good,

205
00:16:33,500 --> 00:16:36,753
enjoining what is right and forbidding what is wrong,

206
00:16:36,978 --> 00:16:38,855
and these will be the successful.

207
00:16:39,145 --> 00:16:45,431
And do not be like the ones, who became divided and deferred after the clear proofs had come to them

208
00:16:45,763 --> 00:16:47,663
and those will have a great punishment.

209
00:16:48,910 --> 00:16:53,302
These are some of the verses, revealed talking about Al-Yahood(يهود)

210
00:16:53,699 --> 00:16:55,024
 and Allahعَزّوجَلّ says,

211
00:16:55,391 --> 00:16:59,650
in another Ayaah(آية) that is referring to another problem

212
00:17:00,123 --> 00:17:04,141
that the Yahood(يهود) suffered from, another disease and that is blasphemy.

213
00:17:04,665 --> 00:17:07,588
They would speak ill about Rasool Allah ﷺ,

214
00:17:07,628 --> 00:17:09,140
they would speak ill about the Muslims,

215
00:17:09,180 --> 00:17:10,569
they would speak ill about Islam,

216
00:17:10,609 --> 00:17:12,379
they would speaking about Allahعَزّوجَلّ.

217
00:17:12,721 --> 00:17:16,374
Allahعَزّوجَلّ says; And this Ayaah(آية) was revealed,

218
00:17:16,778 --> 00:17:19,926
after a conversation happened between Abu Bakr(ابو بكر) and Fanhaas(فينحاس).

219
00:17:20,520 --> 00:17:22,881
Fanhaas(فينحاس) was one of the Jewish rabbis in Madina

220
00:17:23,559 --> 00:17:28,074
and Abu Bakr Siddique رضي الله عنه was giving him Da'wah(دعوة).

221
00:17:28,618 --> 00:17:30,659
So, Fanhaas(فينحاس) responded by saying

222
00:17:31,045 --> 00:17:33,800
 your God is poor, and we are rich.

223
00:17:34,222 --> 00:17:36,798
How can He ask you to give charity?

224
00:17:37,116 --> 00:17:39,773
If your God is rich, He wouldn't be asking you to give Him money.

225
00:17:40,130 --> 00:17:45,195
 That proves that he's a need, and we are rich, and He needs us.

226
00:17:45,624 --> 00:17:48,330
 So, Abu Bakr As-Siddique(ابوبكرالصديق) was quite upset with those words,

227
00:17:48,393 --> 00:17:50,522
 you know, even though he's giving him Da'wah(دعوة) before,

228
00:17:50,562 --> 00:17:53,129
but he started punching him in the face.

229
00:17:53,372 --> 00:17:56,280
 So, Fanhaas(فينحاس) rushes back to Rasool Allah ﷺ, complaining.

230
00:17:56,628 --> 00:17:58,232
He said: This is what Abu Bakr(ابوبكر) did to me.

231
00:17:58,319 --> 00:18:00,455
So, Rasool Allah ﷺ told Abu Bakr(ابوبكر), why did you hit him?

232
00:18:01,058 --> 00:18:03,365
Abu Bakr(ابو بكر) said: because he said this and that.

233
00:18:03,847 --> 00:18:07,128
Fanhaas(فينحاس) denied that he said, those words.

234
00:18:07,572 --> 00:18:10,139
So, Allahعَزّوجَلّ reveals the Ayaah(آية) saying;

235
00:18:10,320 --> 00:18:20,929
لَقَدْ سَمِعَ اللَّهُ قَوْلَ الَّذِينَ قَالُوا إِنَّ اللَّهَ فَقِيرٌ وَنَحْنُ أَغْنِيَاءُ

236
00:18:21,289 --> 00:18:32,977
سَنَكْتُبُ مَا قَالُوا وَقَتْلَهُمُ الْأَنْبِيَاءَ بِغَيْرِ حَقٍّ وَنَقُولُ ذُوقُوا عَذَابَ الْحَرِيقِ

237
00:18:33,304 --> 00:18:43,134
 ذَٰلِكَ بِمَا قَدَّمَتْ أَيْدِيكُمْ وَأَنَّ اللَّهَ لَيْسَ بِظَلَّامٍ لِلْعَبِيدِ۝

238
00:18:43,768 --> 00:18:47,713
Allah has certainly heard the statement of those Jews, who said;

239
00:18:47,935 --> 00:18:50,833
Indeed, Allah is poor, while we are rich,

240
00:18:51,586 --> 00:18:56,944
We will record what they said and their killing of the prophets without right and We'll say,

241
00:18:57,365 --> 00:18:59,648
taste the punishment of the burning fire.

242
00:19:00,615 --> 00:19:02,960
That is for what your hands have put forth,

243
00:19:03,334 --> 00:19:06,439
and Allah is not ever unjust to His servants.

244
00:19:07,364 --> 00:19:09,625
And they would speak ill about the Muslim.

245
00:19:09,665 --> 00:19:10,778
So Allahعَزّوجَلّ said;

246
00:19:10,963 --> 00:19:17,080
لَتُبْلَوُنَّ فِي أَمْوَالِكُمْ وَأَنْفُسِكُمْ

247
00:19:17,374 --> 00:19:28,452
وَلَتَسْمَعُنَّ مِنَ الَّذِينَ أُوتُوا الْكِتَابَ مِنْ قَبْلِكُمْ وَمِنَ الَّذِينَ أَشْرَكُوا أَذًى كَثِيرًا ۚ

248
00:19:28,732 --> 00:19:35,819
وَإِنْ تَصْبِرُوا وَتَتَّقُوا فَإِنَّ ذَٰلِكَ مِنْ عَزْمِ الْأُمُورِ۝

249
00:19:36,333 --> 00:19:40,631
You will surely be tested in your possessions and in yourselves.

250
00:19:41,008 --> 00:19:45,077
And you will surely hear from those, who were given the Scripture before you,

251
00:19:45,367 --> 00:19:48,933
and from those, who associate others with Allah much abuse.

252
00:19:49,182 --> 00:19:51,560
Allahعَزّوجَلّ is telling the Muslims, This is expected.

253
00:19:52,783 --> 00:19:55,602
They will make negative statements about you,

254
00:19:56,009 --> 00:19:59,245
their newspapers will write blasphemous things about you,

255
00:19:59,412 --> 00:20:04,549
their media will accuse you have things that are not true, this is only to be expected.

256
00:20:05,035 --> 00:20:10,049
لَتَسْمَعُنَّ مِنَ الَّذِينَ أُوتُوا الْكِتَابَ مِنْ قَبْلِكُمْ وَمِنَ الَّذِينَ أَشْرَكُوا أَذًى كَثِيرًا ۚ

257
00:20:10,847 --> 00:20:13,353
And then Allahعَزّوجَلّ says but if you are patient,

258
00:20:13,553 --> 00:20:19,102
and fear Allah, indeed that is of the matters worthy of determination.

259
00:20:20,198 --> 00:20:24,545
Their propaganda will not affect Islam or the Muslims,

260
00:20:24,769 --> 00:20:28,575
as long as the Muslims are patient and have Taqwa(تقوى).

261
00:20:29,243 --> 00:20:32,491
Because the truth remains and lies vanish.

262
00:20:33,730 --> 00:20:37,006
And they were disrespectful of Rasool Allah ﷺ.

263
00:20:37,929 --> 00:20:39,958
They came to him once and they were saying;

264
00:20:39,998 --> 00:20:42,317
اَلسَّامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا رَسُوْلَ الله

265
00:20:43,248 --> 00:20:45,237
Now this sounds very close to,

266
00:20:45,277 --> 00:20:47,460
اَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا رَسُوْلَ الله

267
00:20:48,070 --> 00:20:51,005
So, they will take out the laam(ل) The L,

268
00:20:51,514 --> 00:20:53,688
Instead of Salaam(سلام) they would say Sam(سام)

269
00:20:54,179 --> 00:20:59,301
And اَسَّامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا رَسُوْلَ الله could mean may death befall you,

270
00:20:59,990 --> 00:21:01,559
may death befall you.

271
00:21:02,119 --> 00:21:04,033
So, Ayesha(عائشه) was very upset and she said;

272
00:21:04,084 --> 00:21:05,087
اَسَّامُ عَلَيْكَمْ

273
00:21:05,127 --> 00:21:08,771
You sons of monkeys and pigs and she was cursing them.

274
00:21:09,337 --> 00:21:12,804
So, Rasool Allah ﷺ said; Don't say that, O Ayesha(عائشه)

275
00:21:12,844 --> 00:21:15,298
 because Allahعَزّوجَلّ doesn't like foul language,

276
00:21:15,764 --> 00:21:17,815
and then Allahعَزّوجَلّ reveal the Ayaah(آية).

277
00:21:17,990 --> 00:21:25,961
أَلَمْ تَرَ إِلَى الَّذِينَ نُهُوا عَنِ النَّجْوَىٰ ثُمَّ يَعُودُونَ لِمَا نُهُوا عَنْهُ

278
00:21:26,279 --> 00:21:32,866
وَيَتَنَاجَوْنَ بِالْإِثْمِ وَالْعُدْوَانِ وَمَعْصِيَتِ الرَّسُولِ

279
00:21:33,871 --> 00:21:40,820
وَإِذَا جَاءُوكَ حَيَّوْكَ بِمَا لَمْ يُحَيِّكَ بِهِ اللَّهُ

280
00:21:41,145 --> 00:21:49,942
 وَيَقُولُونَ فِي أَنْفُسِهِمْ لَوْلَا يُعَذِّبُنَا اللَّهُ بِمَا نَقُولُ ۚ

281
00:21:50,379 --> 00:21:56,790
حَسْبُهُمْ جَهَنَّمُ يَصْلَوْنَهَا ۖ فَبِئْسَ الْمَصِيرُ۝

282
00:21:57,315 --> 00:22:02,549
Have you not considered those, who were forbidden from private conversation,

283
00:22:02,787 --> 00:22:05,199
 i.e. ridicule, and conspiracy.

284
00:22:05,469 --> 00:22:09,576
Then they return to that which they were forbidden and converse,

285
00:22:09,982 --> 00:22:15,027
among themselves about sin and aggression and disobedience to the messenger.

286
00:22:15,674 --> 00:22:19,002
And when they come to you, they greet you with that word,

287
00:22:19,259 --> 00:22:23,367
by which Allah does not greet you and say among themselves,

288
00:22:23,515 --> 00:22:26,277
Why does Allah not punish us, for what we say?

289
00:22:26,491 --> 00:22:31,244
So, they would say, we are speaking these ill words about Rasool Allah ﷺ, and nothing's happening to us.

290
00:22:31,306 --> 00:22:34,407
 So, this is evidence that he is not really the Messenger of Allah

291
00:22:34,569 --> 00:22:37,539
Allahعَزّوجَلّ said, sufficient for them is hell,

292
00:22:37,866 --> 00:22:42,616
which they will enter to burn and retched is the destination.

293
00:22:45,215 --> 00:22:47,728
The Yahood(يهود) was also support the hypocrites

294
00:22:47,791 --> 00:22:52,418
and they were the spiritual advisors to the hypocrites.

295
00:22:53,156 --> 00:22:54,368
 Allahعَزّوجَلّ says;

296
00:22:54,659 --> 00:23:01,947
وَإِذَا لَقُوا الَّذِينَ آمَنُوا قَالُوا آمَنَّا

297
00:23:02,336 --> 00:23:13,367
وَإِذَا خَلَوْا إِلَىٰ شَيَاطِينِهِمْ قَالُوا إِنَّا مَعَكُمْ إِنَّمَا نَحْنُ مُسْتَهْزِئُونَ۝

298
00:23:15,004 --> 00:23:18,775
And when they meet those, who believe they say we believe

299
00:23:19,459 --> 00:23:21,891
but when they are alone, with their evil ones,

300
00:23:22,701 --> 00:23:25,550
they say, and the evil ones here is referring to Al-Yahood(اليهود).

301
00:23:25,680 --> 00:23:29,952
They say; Indeed, we are with you, we were only mockers.

302
00:23:31,236 --> 00:23:34,295
And Allahعَزّوجَلّ says about the Munafiqeen(منافقين) also;

303
00:23:34,618 --> 00:23:47,519
إِنَّ الَّذِينَ ارْتَدُّوا عَلَىٰ أَدْبَارِهِمْ مِنْ بَعْدِ مَا تَبَيَّنَ لَهُمُ الْهُدَى ۙ الشَّيْطَانُ سَوَّلَ لَهُمْ وَأَمْلَىٰ لَهُمْ۝

304
00:23:48,003 --> 00:24:00,445
ذَٰلِكَ بِأَنَّهُمْ قَالُوا لِلَّذِينَ كَرِهُوا مَا نَزَّلَ اللَّهُ سَنُطِيعُكُمْ فِي بَعْضِ الْأَمْرِ ۖ وَاللَّهُ يَعْلَمُ إِسْرَارَهُمْ۝

305
00:24:01,115 --> 00:24:03,709
Indeed, those who reverted back to disbelief

306
00:24:04,061 --> 00:24:06,569
After guidance had become clear to them.

307
00:24:06,935 --> 00:24:10,230
Satan enticed them and prolonged hope for them.

308
00:24:10,779 --> 00:24:14,168
That is because they say to those, who disliked, what Allah has sent down,

309
00:24:14,272 --> 00:24:15,643
 this is referring to Al-Yahood(اليهود).

310
00:24:16,089 --> 00:24:20,309
That is because they said, to those who disliked what Allah sent down,

311
00:24:20,655 --> 00:24:25,589
we will obey you in part of the matter,

312
00:24:25,851 --> 00:24:27,983
and Allah knows what they conceal.

313
00:24:28,111 --> 00:24:29,347
So, Allahعَزّوجَلّ is saying

314
00:24:30,046 --> 00:24:33,019
that if you only obey them, in part of the matter, not all of it,

315
00:24:33,161 --> 00:24:35,564
if you only obey them in a small thing,

316
00:24:36,111 --> 00:24:40,883
that is sufficient to classify a person as somebody who has left the fold of Islam,

317
00:24:40,927 --> 00:24:42,049
 somebody who's a Munafiq(منافق).

318
00:24:42,448 --> 00:24:45,341
So, as a Muslims, we need to be very careful about this issue,

319
00:24:45,574 --> 00:24:52,219
and not to fall into the prey of being seduced by Al-Yahood(اليهود) and An-Nasarah(النصارى).

320
00:24:52,698 --> 00:24:53,997
And Allahعَزّوجَلّ says;

321
00:24:54,376 --> 00:25:04,726
أَلَمْ تَرَ إِلَى الَّذِينَ تَوَلَّوْا قَوْمًا غَضِبَ اللَّهُ عَلَيْهِمْ مَا هُمْ مِنْكُمْ وَلَا مِنْهُمْ

322
00:25:05,129 --> 00:25:13,837
مَا هُمْ مِنْكُمْ وَلَا مِنْهُمْ وَيَحْلِفُونَ عَلَى الْكَذِبِ وَهُمْ يَعْلَمُونَ۝

323
00:25:14,321 --> 00:25:19,496
أَعَدَّ اللَّهُ لَهُمْ عَذَابًا شَدِيدًا ۖ

324
00:25:19,845 --> 00:25:25,972
إِنَّهُمْ سَاءَ مَا كَانُوا يَعْمَلُونَ۝

325
00:25:26,480 --> 00:25:37,570
اِتَّخَذُوا أَيْمَانَهُمْ جُنَّةً فَصَدُّوا عَنْ سَبِيلِ اللَّهِ فَلَهُمْ عَذَابٌ مُهِينٌ۝

326
00:25:37,930 --> 00:25:42,824
Have you not considered, those who make allies of a people with whom Allah has become angry.

327
00:25:43,180 --> 00:25:47,670
And the people whom Allah has become angry as it is, in Surat-El-Fatiha(سورة الفاتحه), is Al-Yahood(اليهود),

328
00:25:48,210 --> 00:25:53,019
 they are neither of you nor of them, and they swear to untruth

329
00:25:53,146 --> 00:25:54,860
while they know, they are lying.

330
00:25:55,198 --> 00:25:57,708
Allah has, prepared for them a severe punishment.

331
00:25:58,050 --> 00:26:01,642
Indeed, it was evil that they were doing.

332
00:26:01,955 --> 00:26:04,659
They took their false oath as a cover,

333
00:26:04,883 --> 00:26:10,002
so they averted people from the way of Allah and for them is a humiliating punishment.

334
00:26:11,478 --> 00:26:15,282
And another thing that Al-Yahood(اليهود) were doing in Madina,

335
00:26:15,322 --> 00:26:19,561
they were trying to block the path of people becoming Muslim.

336
00:26:19,749 --> 00:26:23,704
So, for example, with Abdullah Bin Salaam(عبدالله بن سلام), immediately, as soon as he became Muslim,

337
00:26:23,744 --> 00:26:30,184
they started accusing him of being a liar and accusing him of being unfaithful to his people

338
00:26:30,224 --> 00:26:33,580
 and to his religion and all that, we already talked about his story.

339
00:26:34,686 --> 00:26:37,118
And they would not only do that with Abdullah Bin Salaam(عبدالله بن سلام),

340
00:26:37,142 --> 00:26:39,841
they would even do it with the Arabs who become Muslim.

341
00:26:40,366 --> 00:26:44,850
They'd tell them that your religion is better than their religion and all of that.

342
00:26:44,898 --> 00:26:49,212
When it should be expected that Yahood(يهود) will consider the Muslims to be closer to them,

343
00:26:49,427 --> 00:26:51,924
 than the pagan worshippers, but that wasn't the case.

344
00:26:53,241 --> 00:26:59,873
So, obviously, all of this would lead the Muslims and the Yahood(يهود) to confrontation.

345
00:27:00,434 --> 00:27:02,808
You know, you can't have all of this happening

346
00:27:03,554 --> 00:27:06,314
without Rasool Allah ﷺ responding to it.

347
00:27:06,840 --> 00:27:08,869
So, they were on a collision course.

348
00:27:09,553 --> 00:27:12,375
And after the Battle of Badr(بدر),

349
00:27:13,020 --> 00:27:15,891
Rasool Allah ﷺ went to the Yahood(يهود) of Bannu Qainuqah(بنوقينقاع),

350
00:27:15,931 --> 00:27:20,549
 who were the closest to the Muslims, in terms of location, they were living in Madina itself,

351
00:27:21,068 --> 00:27:24,390
unlike Bannu Quraidha(بنو قريظة) and Bannu An-Nadhir(بنو نضير),

352
00:27:24,430 --> 00:27:26,450
who were living on the outskirts of Madina.

353
00:27:27,493 --> 00:27:30,766
So, Rasool Allah ﷺ goes to the Yahood(يهود) of Bannu Qainuqah(بنوقينقاع).

354
00:27:31,155 --> 00:27:37,672
And he speaks to them, he said: O Jews, beware of Allah afflicting you, as He did Quraish(قُرَيْشْ).

355
00:27:38,228 --> 00:27:41,542
So, Rasool Allah ﷺ is telling them; Take heed at what happened.

356
00:27:42,153 --> 00:27:47,467
You've seen how Allah humiliated Quraish(قُرَيْشْ) and how He has given His Prophet victory.

357
00:27:48,272 --> 00:27:50,626
 Do not let the same thing happened to you.

358
00:27:51,433 --> 00:27:53,876
So, Rasool Allah ﷺ here is delivering a warning to them

359
00:27:54,289 --> 00:27:57,828
because of all of their plotting and planning against him

360
00:27:57,868 --> 00:28:03,341
and all of the Fitna(فتنه) that they were causing among the Muslims, Rasool Allah ﷺ went to warn them.

361
00:28:04,236 --> 00:28:10,037
He's giving them Naseeha(نصيحه), O, Jews, Beware of Allah afflicting you, as He did Quraish(قُرَيْشْ),

362
00:28:10,242 --> 00:28:11,584
and so accept Islam,

363
00:28:12,381 --> 00:28:15,871
you well know that I am a Prophet sent with a mission,

364
00:28:16,207 --> 00:28:20,879
you find that to be so in your book, and in Allah's pact with you.

365
00:28:22,347 --> 00:28:23,471
What was their response?

366
00:28:24,260 --> 00:28:28,061
They said; Muhammad(محمد), do you think, we are your people?

367
00:28:28,802 --> 00:28:30,290
Don't delude yourself,

368
00:28:31,042 --> 00:28:35,137
just because you did battle with those who lack knowledge of warfare.

369
00:28:35,627 --> 00:28:37,699
And so you could take advantage of them.

370
00:28:38,093 --> 00:28:41,827
If you fight against us, you'll find us to be the real men.

371
00:28:42,794 --> 00:28:46,430
So, the Yahood(يهود) are saying that you are fought against people who have no experience with war.

372
00:28:46,838 --> 00:28:51,291
People who don't know the tactics of war, they don't have the experience.

373
00:28:51,616 --> 00:28:56,194
 But if you fight against us you'll know that we are real men.

374
00:28:56,966 --> 00:28:58,244
Allahعَزّوجَلّ said;

375
00:28:58,596 --> 00:29:06,192
قُلْ لِلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا سَتُغْلَبُونَ وَتُحْشَرُونَ إِلَىٰ جَهَنَّمَ ۚ

376
00:29:06,382 --> 00:29:09,707
وَبِئْسَ الْمِهَادُ ۝

377
00:29:09,866 --> 00:29:15,603
قَدْ كَانَ لَكُمْ آيَةٌ فِي فِئَتَيْنِ الْتَقَتَا ۖ

378
00:29:15,855 --> 00:29:26,748
فِئَةٌ تُقَاتِلُ فِي سَبِيلِ اللَّهِ وَأُخْرَىٰ كَافِرَةٌ يَرَوْنَهُمْ مِثْلَيْهِمْ رَأْيَ الْعَيْنِ ۚ

379
00:29:27,026 --> 00:29:32,578
وَاللَّهُ يُؤَيِّدُ بِنَصْرِهِ مَنْ يَشَاءُ ۗ

380
00:29:32,816 --> 00:29:39,285
إِنَّ فِي ذَٰلِكَ لَعِبْرَةً لِأُولِي الْأَبْصَارِ۝

381
00:29:39,865 --> 00:29:42,910
You have vision, you learn a lesson from that.

382
00:29:43,558 --> 00:29:50,940
But the Yahood(يهود) were so stubborn, they refused to accept the advice of Rasool Allah ﷺ.

383
00:29:51,609 --> 00:29:56,368
So, one day, and we're talking about right after the Battle of Badr(بدر),

384
00:29:56,965 --> 00:29:59,197
a Muslim woman goes to the marketplace,

385
00:29:59,386 --> 00:30:03,183
which as we said the jewelry market was controlled by the Jews.

386
00:30:03,890 --> 00:30:08,801
So this Muslim woman went to sell or trade, some jewelry that she had.

387
00:30:09,182 --> 00:30:12,238
 So, she sits next to this store.

388
00:30:13,140 --> 00:30:15,444
She's sitting on the floor.

389
00:30:16,087 --> 00:30:21,167
And she gives her jewelry to the Jewish owner at this shop.

390
00:30:22,520 --> 00:30:28,317
So, some Jews were gathering and they asked her to uncover her face.

391
00:30:29,985 --> 00:30:31,110
She refused.

392
00:30:31,555 --> 00:30:36,649
 So, the owner of the store, he goes behind her without her knowing.

393
00:30:37,240 --> 00:30:42,734
And he pins, the bottom of her dress to her back.

394
00:30:43,425 --> 00:30:49,314
 Now when she was sitting on the floor obviously her dress would be dragging on the floor.

395
00:30:49,745 --> 00:30:52,274
So, when he pinned it to her back, she didn't feel that,

396
00:30:52,409 --> 00:30:54,012
she was unaware of what he was doing.

397
00:30:54,274 --> 00:30:58,552
But when she stood up, what happened is that, she was exposed

398
00:30:59,675 --> 00:31:03,849
because of the dress being pinned to her back when she stood up,

399
00:31:04,126 --> 00:31:07,564
her legs or part of her Auwra(عورة) was exposed.

400
00:31:08,306 --> 00:31:12,173
So, she screamed, a Muslim, who was there and saw what happened,

401
00:31:12,498 --> 00:31:14,753
 attacked the Yahoodi(يهودي) and killed him.

402
00:31:15,244 --> 00:31:19,427
And then the Jews ganged up against the Muslim and killed him.

403
00:31:20,414 --> 00:31:23,421
The news was delivered to Rasool Allah ﷺ immediately.

404
00:31:23,988 --> 00:31:31,191
He called the army and went to Bannu Qainuqah(بنوقينقاع) and laid siege to their forts.

405
00:31:32,635 --> 00:31:35,072
Immediately, No questions asked.

406
00:31:36,567 --> 00:31:42,615
The Muslim woman she was violated, this is an invitation to war.

407
00:31:43,706 --> 00:31:47,326
Rasool Allah ﷺ laid siege to their forts for 15 days.

408
00:31:48,012 --> 00:31:51,894
And these Yahood(يهود), who were bragging about their skills as fighters,

409
00:31:51,934 --> 00:31:54,889
 and their training, and the weakness of Quraish(قُرَيْشْ).

410
00:31:55,261 --> 00:31:57,696
Were now shaking in their forts.

411
00:31:58,061 --> 00:32:01,696
 And they were willing to surrender.

412
00:32:03,369 --> 00:32:06,690
So, Abdullah Bin Ubaye(عبدالله بن ابيئ), who was their ally in Jahiliyyag(جاهليه),

413
00:32:07,880 --> 00:32:15,651
goes to Rasool Allah ﷺ and tries to appeal for his allies.

414
00:32:16,264 --> 00:32:19,042
Ubadah Bin Samit(عبادة بن صامت), who was also their ally.

415
00:32:19,570 --> 00:32:24,449
Both Abdullah Bin Ubaye(عبدالله بن ابيئ) and Ubadah Bin Samit(عبادة بن صامت), were equally the allies of Bannu Qainuqah(بنوقينقاع).

416
00:32:24,710 --> 00:32:31,299
They both went to Rasool Allah ﷺ but look at the difference in the position of these two men,

417
00:32:31,682 --> 00:32:34,012
Ubadah Bin Samit(عبادة بن صامت) was now a good Muslim.

418
00:32:34,877 --> 00:32:37,158
So, he goes to Rasool Allah ﷺ and says;

419
00:32:38,713 --> 00:32:42,808
Messenger, of Allah, My only loyalty is to Allah

420
00:32:43,233 --> 00:32:45,823
He, His Messenger and the believers,

421
00:32:46,140 --> 00:32:51,391
I renounced the alliance with those unbelievers and I will give them no support whatsoever.

422
00:32:52,611 --> 00:32:54,334
So, he does this at his own initiative.

423
00:32:54,519 --> 00:32:56,329
It's not Rasool Allah ﷺ, who invited him,

424
00:32:56,543 --> 00:33:00,029
He goes to Rasool Allah and makes it known, that O Rasool Ullah,

425
00:33:00,337 --> 00:33:05,660
Yes, I was their ally in the time of Jahilliyyah(جاهليه), and this alliances is old.

426
00:33:06,486 --> 00:33:09,168
And we are fought together in many occasions.

427
00:33:09,800 --> 00:33:15,840
But right now, I'm announcing that my loyalty goes to Allah, Rasool Ullah and the believers

428
00:33:16,197 --> 00:33:20,130
 and I renounced my ties with the people of Bannu Qainuqah(بنوقينقاع).

429
00:33:21,685 --> 00:33:27,852
While Abdullah Bin Ubaye(عبدالله بن ابيئ) goes to Rasool Allah ﷺ and says; Be good to my allies,

430
00:33:29,564 --> 00:33:32,105
Be good to my allies. Rasool Allah ﷺ does not answer back.

431
00:33:34,180 --> 00:33:38,649
So, then Abdullah Bin Ubaye(عبدالله بن ابيئ) goes to Rasool Allah ﷺ another time, and said: Be good to my allies.

432
00:33:39,830 --> 00:33:41,699
Rasool Allah ﷺ does not respond back.

433
00:33:42,207 --> 00:33:48,379
So, Abdullah Bin Ubaye(عبدالله بن ابي) puts his hand, in the pocket of Rasool Allah ﷺ and pulls him

434
00:33:48,993 --> 00:33:53,451
and refuses to let him go, and then said, Be good to my allies.

435
00:33:53,528 --> 00:33:55,554
 So, Rasool Allah ﷺ, told him; Let me go.

436
00:33:56,528 --> 00:34:00,742
And the narrator of this Hadith(حديث) said, The face of Rasool Allah ﷺ became angry,

437
00:34:00,782 --> 00:34:03,945
 you can see anger in the face of Rasool Allah ﷺ, he is telling Abdullah Bin Ubaye(عبدالله بن ابي),

438
00:34:03,985 --> 00:34:04,977
 وَيْحَكَ اَرْسِلْنِيْ

439
00:34:05,024 --> 00:34:06,429
Woe to you, let me go.

440
00:34:06,719 --> 00:34:09,868
And Abdullah Bin Ubaye(عبدالله بن ابي) is holding tight to Rasool Allah ﷺ and said;

441
00:34:10,042 --> 00:34:13,248
 I will not let you go, until you are good to my allies.

442
00:34:14,411 --> 00:34:16,288
They are 700 fighters,

443
00:34:16,658 --> 00:34:19,266
who protected me against all my enemies.

444
00:34:19,525 --> 00:34:22,244
And now you want to mow them down in one morning.

445
00:34:22,812 --> 00:34:26,155
I am a man, who fears the terms of fortune.

446
00:34:26,786 --> 00:34:29,994
I'm not gonna let you go, until you let them free.

447
00:34:31,303 --> 00:34:33,462
They have helped me in numerous occasions

448
00:34:33,778 --> 00:34:36,667
and now you just want to execute all of these men in one day.

449
00:34:37,484 --> 00:34:41,862
Rasool Allah ﷺ told him, They are yours. They are yours.

450
00:34:42,310 --> 00:34:44,319
Rasool Allah ﷺ, let them free.

451
00:34:45,720 --> 00:34:50,074
So, the people of Bannu Qainuqah(بنوقينقاع) were set free, they were allowed to leave.

452
00:34:50,904 --> 00:34:58,653
And the one, who would administer their traveling was Ubadah Bin Samit(عبادة بن صامت),

453
00:34:59,458 --> 00:35:02,336
and they traveled to Ash-sham(الشام), Syria.

454
00:35:03,063 --> 00:35:08,548
Their money was taken as Ghaneemah(غنيمه), as booty of war and was distributed among the Muslims.

455
00:35:10,734 --> 00:35:16,063
Some Ayaat(آيات) were revealed regarding Abdullah Bin Ubaye(عبدالله بن ابي) and Ubadah Bin Samit(عبادة بن صامت)

456
00:35:16,147 --> 00:35:23,692
 because this showed the position of both men regarding their loyalty and their alliance to Al-Yahood(اليهود).

457
00:35:24,047 --> 00:35:25,106
Allahعَزّوجَلّ says;

458
00:35:25,514 --> 00:35:37,903
يَا أَيُّهَا الَّذِينَ آمَنُوا لَا تَتَّخِذُوا الْيَهُودَ وَالنَّصَارَىٰ أَوْلِيَاءَ ۘ

459
00:35:38,523 --> 00:35:42,594
بَعْضُهُمْ أَوْلِيَاءُ بَعْضٍ ۚ

460
00:35:42,880 --> 00:35:48,660
وَمَنْ يَتَوَلَّهُمْ مِنْكُمْ فَإِنَّهُ مِنْهُمْ ۗ

461
00:35:48,906 --> 00:35:54,097
إِنَّ اللَّهَ لَا يَهْدِي الْقَوْمَ الظَّالِمِينَ۝

462
00:35:54,646 --> 00:35:56,046
O you, who has believed!

463
00:35:56,931 --> 00:36:00,182
Do not take the Jews and the Christians as allies,

464
00:36:00,645 --> 00:36:03,216
they are in fact, allies of one another.

465
00:36:03,889 --> 00:36:08,499
And whoever is an ally to them among you, then indeed he is one of them.

466
00:36:08,888 --> 00:36:12,392
Indeed, Allah guides, not the wrong doing people.

467
00:36:13,613 --> 00:36:17,372
So, you see those in whose hearts is disease, i.e. hypocrisy

468
00:36:17,903 --> 00:36:20,822
hastening into associating with them,

469
00:36:20,900 --> 00:36:24,293
saying; We are afraid the misfortune may strike us.

470
00:36:24,554 --> 00:36:26,447
You see, this talking about Abdullah Bin Ubaye(عبدالله بن ابي).

471
00:36:26,958 --> 00:36:33,182
So, he's worried that disaster might befall him, if his alliance with Yahood(يهود) is revoked

472
00:36:33,285 --> 00:36:37,055
 somehow, he thinks that his protection lies with them.

473
00:36:37,484 --> 00:36:40,614
If I don't keep this alliance, evil will befall me,

474
00:36:40,638 --> 00:36:41,596
something will happen,

475
00:36:41,636 --> 00:36:44,636
so he doesn't have Tawakkul(توكل) in Allahعَزّوجَلّ, he's afraid.

476
00:36:45,265 --> 00:36:52,933
فَتَرَى الَّذِينَ فِي قُلُوبِهِمْ مَرَضٌ يُسَارِعُونَ فِيهِمْ

477
00:36:53,250 --> 00:37:00,396
يَقُولُونَ نَخْشَىٰ أَنْ تُصِيبَنَا دَائِرَةٌ ۚ

478
00:37:00,659 --> 00:37:08,444
فَعَسَى اللَّهُ أَنْ يَأْتِيَ بِالْفَتْحِ أَوْ أَمْرٍ مِنْ عِنْدِهِ فَيُصْبِحُوا

479
00:37:08,642 --> 00:37:16,397
 فَيُصْبِحُوا عَلَىٰ مَا أَسَرُّوا فِي أَنْفُسِهِمْ نَادِمِينَ۝

480
00:37:17,177 --> 00:37:20,127
We are afraid a misfortune may strike us

481
00:37:20,238 --> 00:37:24,886
 but perhaps Allah will bring conquest or decision from Him

482
00:37:25,099 --> 00:37:30,722
and they will become over what they have been concealing within themselves regretful.

483
00:37:31,131 --> 00:37:32,937
Meaning Allah will give the believers victory

484
00:37:33,080 --> 00:37:37,399
and they will win against these people, whom you consider allies and think that they're the ones who will protect you.

485
00:37:39,475 --> 00:37:40,278
And then Allah says;

486
00:37:40,588 --> 00:37:53,561
وَيَقُولُ الَّذِينَ آمَنُوا أَهَٰؤُلَاءِ الَّذِينَ أَقْسَمُوا بِاللَّهِ جَهْدَ أَيْمَانِهِمْ ۙ إِنَّهُمْ لَمَعَكُمْ ۚ

487
00:37:53,862 --> 00:37:58,538
حَبِطَتْ أَعْمَالُهُمْ فَأَصْبَحُوا خَاسِرِينَ۝

488
00:37:58,888 --> 00:38:10,502
يَا أَيُّهَا الَّذِينَ آمَنُوا مَنْ يَرْتَدَّ مِنْكُمْ عَنْ دِينِهِ فَسَوْفَ يَأْتِي اللَّهُ بِقَوْمٍ

489
00:38:10,806 --> 00:38:16,770
فَسَوْفَ يَأْتِي اللَّهُ بِقَوْمٍ يُحِبُّهُمْ وَيُحِبُّونَهُ

490
00:38:17,039 --> 00:38:23,206
أَذِلَّةٍ عَلَى الْمُؤْمِنِينَ أَعِزَّةٍ عَلَى الْكَافِرِينَ۝

491
00:38:23,510 --> 00:38:31,485
يُجَاهِدُونَ فِي سَبِيلِ اللَّهِ وَلَا يَخَافُونَ لَوْمَةَ لَائِمٍ ۚ

492
00:38:31,667 --> 00:38:40,999
ذَٰلِكَ فَضْلُ اللَّهِ يُؤْتِيهِ مَنْ يَشَاءُ ۚ وَاللَّهُ وَاسِعٌ عَلِيمٌ۝

493
00:38:41,467 --> 00:38:43,569
And those who believe will say;

494
00:38:43,903 --> 00:38:49,865
Are these the ones who swore by Allah, their strongest oath that indeed they will be with you.

495
00:38:50,749 --> 00:38:54,549
Their deeds have become worthless and they have become losers.

496
00:38:55,144 --> 00:38:59,745
O, you, who have believed whoever of you, should revert from His religion.

497
00:39:00,252 --> 00:39:06,159
Allah will bring forth in place of them a people, He will love and who will love Him,

498
00:39:06,615 --> 00:39:08,835
who are humble toward the believers,

499
00:39:09,187 --> 00:39:11,155
powerful against the disbelievers,

500
00:39:11,603 --> 00:39:13,411
they strike in the cause of Allah.

501
00:39:14,228 --> 00:39:19,461
They strive meaning fight Jihad(جهاد) in the cause of Allah and do not fear the blame of a critic.

502
00:39:20,543 --> 00:39:25,349
So, this Ayaah(آية) has the attributes of At-Taefah Al-Mansoura(ألطائفة منصورة), the victorious party.

503
00:39:25,421 --> 00:39:30,374
Again, Allah will bring forth, a people He will love and who will love Him.

504
00:39:30,429 --> 00:39:32,318
So, number one, Allah loves them.

505
00:39:32,477 --> 00:39:34,003
Number two, they love Allah.

506
00:39:34,684 --> 00:39:37,225
Who are humble towards the believers, that's number three,

507
00:39:37,738 --> 00:39:40,476
powerful against the disbelievers, number four.

508
00:39:40,885 --> 00:39:44,638
They strive, they fight Jihad(جهاد) in the cause of Allah, number five,

509
00:39:45,052 --> 00:39:48,413
and do not fear the blame of a critic, that's number six.

510
00:39:48,999 --> 00:39:51,023
They don't care about what the media will say about them.

511
00:39:51,091 --> 00:39:53,332
They don't care about what so, and so will say about them.

512
00:39:53,388 --> 00:39:56,018
They don't care what the disbelievers say about them,

513
00:39:56,269 --> 00:39:58,769
as long as it pleases Allahعَزّوجَلّ. That's enough.

514
00:39:59,599 --> 00:40:04,104
That is the favor of Allah, He bestows it upon whom He wills,

515
00:40:04,501 --> 00:40:07,149
and Allah is all encompassing and knowing.

516
00:40:07,775 --> 00:40:14,089
وَمَنْ يَتَوَلَّ اللَّهَ وَرَسُولَهُ وَالَّذِينَ آمَنُوا

517
00:40:14,247 --> 00:40:19,954
فَإِنَّ حِزْبَ اللَّهِ هُمُ الْغَالِبُونَ۝

518
00:40:20,890 --> 00:40:26,421
Your ally is none but Allah, and therefore His Messenger and those who have believed

519
00:40:26,775 --> 00:40:30,106
indeed the party of Allah, they will be the predominant.

520
00:40:30,589 --> 00:40:34,411
See, Ubadah Bin Samit(عبادة بن صامت)  was approached by Abdullah Bin Ubaye(عبدالله بن ابيئ),

521
00:40:35,117 --> 00:40:36,690
and Abdullah Bin Ubaye(عبدالله بن ابيئ) told him,

522
